title: 밤_3_무관_영문
---
<<bg 검은화면>>
(Just as I was about to head out, I got a notification.)
<<play 띠롱띠롱>>
<<wait 1>>
ASan: (B1, 11-gil 4, Dosan-daero, Gangnam-gu)
ASan: (Come if you’ve got nothing better to do.)
ASan: (I’m leaving if you’re not here in 10 mins.)
<<play 띠롱띠롱>>
<<wait 1>>
(Then, another message came in.)
NaHyun: (What’s up? You’re not sleeping already, are you?)
NaHyun: (Did you finish the assignment? If not, let’s hit a cafe and study together.)
<<play 띠롱띠롱>>
<<wait 1>>
(And yet another one.)
EunPyo: ({name()}~ What are you up to??)
EunPyo: (If you’re not busy, wanna come out for a bit? I’m at Mulbit Park.)
Who should I go meet?
-> ASan
    <<jump 밤_3_무관_신아산_영문>>
-> NaHyun
    <<jump 밤_3_무관_양나현_영문>>
-> EunPyo
    <<jump 밤_3_무관_서은표_영문>>
===

title: 밤_3_무관_양나현_영문
---
<<bg 특_카페>>
(After getting NaHyun’s text, I arrived in front of the cafe.)
<<show hyun_idle_ver2>>
<<play hyun_sound>>
(After a short wait, NaHyun approached me.)
NaHyun: Hey, {name()}.
{name()}: NaHyun.
{name()}: What’s the occasion? You asking me to study together?
<<show hyun_neg_ver2>>
NaHyun: What do you mean "what’s the occasion"?
NaHyun: I do study when I have to.
<<show hyun_idle_ver2>>
NaHyun: Let’s head in.
(We went inside, ordered drinks, and found a spot near an outlet.)
(I sat down and pulled out my laptop alongside NaHyun.)
NaHyun: (Staring at her screen) You know that assignment due today.
{name()}: Right. Did you get much done?
NaHyun: Nope, haven’t even started.
NaHyun: I'm starting... now.
<<choice 밤_3_무관_양나현_긍정1_영문 "Yeah, finished it yesterday." 밤_3_무관_양나현_부정1_영문 "Nah, I haven't started either.">>
NaHyun: How about you?
===

title: 밤_3_무관_양나현_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: Yeah, finished it yesterday.
{name()}: It’s always better to get it over with early.
<<choice 밤_3_무관_양나현_긍정2_영문 "Sure. I'll help you." 밤_3_무관_양나현_부정2_영문 "Try doing it on your own.">>
NaHyun: Really? Then... could you maybe help me out a bit?
===

title: 밤_3_무관_양나현_긍정2_영문
---
<<change lvHyun +5>>
<<like 양나현>>
{name()}: Sure, I'll help you.
{name()}: It shouldn't be that hard.
(I worked on the assignment with NaHyun.)
(With the two of us working together, we finished it in no time.)
<<jump 밤_3_무관_양나현_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 밤_3_무관_양나현_부정2_영문
---
{name()}: Nah, try doing it yourself.
{name()}: I think this might be on the exam.
<<choice 밤_3_무관_양나현_긍정2_영문 "Alright, fine." 밤_3_무관_양나현_부정2_영문 "No way.">>
NaHyun: But still... can't you help just a little?
===

title: 밤_3_무관_양나현_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: Nah, I haven't even started yet.
NaHyun: Let’s do it together then.
{name()}: Sounds good to me.
(I worked on the assignment with NaHyun.)
(With the two of us working together, we finished it in no time.)
<<jump 밤_3_무관_양나현_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 밤_3_무관_양나현_분기1_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle_ver2>>
NaHyun: I don't even remember the last time I turned something in on time.
{name()}: Feels good to be done, though, right?
NaHyun: Yeah. But after using my brain this much, I really don't want to go to class tomorrow.
{name()}: Thinking of pulling a "dip after attendance"?
NaHyun: I'll think about it when I wake up.
(Time flew by while we worked, and the staff announced they were closing.)
NaHyun: Let's head home now.
{name()}: Sure.
(After tidying up, I said goodbye to NaHyun and we parted ways.)
<<end>>
===

title: 밤_3_무관_신아산_영문
---
<<bg 특_노래방>>
(I arrived at the address ASan abruptly sent me.)
{name()}: B1, 11-gil 4, Dosan-daero, Gangnam-gu... Byeol-Byeol-Byeol Karaoke?
<<show san_smile_ver2>>
<<play san_sound>>
ASan: Oh, {name()}!!!!!
(ASan seems to be in an exceptionally good mood today.)
{name()}: You seem really happy today. Did something good happen?
<<if get("lvSan") >= 35>>
    <<jump 밤_3_무관_신아산_특수_영문>>
<<else>>
    <<jump 밤_3_무관_신아산_일반_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 밤_3_무관_신아산_특수_영문
---
ASan: Yep~~
ASan: I'm just in a good mood because it's been a while since I've been to karaoke.
ASan: Wanna sing with me?
{name()}: Sure.
(We went into the karaoke room together.)
(ASan and I are sitting side by side in the cramped room.)
<<show san_blush_ver2>>
(Breaking the silence, ASan spoke first.)
ASan: I'm going first.
ASan: You never know when I'll be the lead vocal at a gig, so I need to practice singing too!!!!
ASan: Along with my bass!
{name()}: You even brought your bass?
ASan: Yeah!
ASan: Just wait and see.
<<show san_smile_ver2>>
ASan: Congratulations, you're so amazing~~~~~~~~~~~
ASan: Congratulations, how could you do that~~~~~~~~~~~
<<wait 1>>
<<show san_blush_ver2>>
ASan: How was it?
ASan: Honestly, I'm still practicing the vocals, and, uh, that vibrato part—
{name()}: You're actually really good.
{name()}: You could totally switch to lead vocal.
<<change lvSan 10>>
<<like 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Re-really?
ASan: You're... you're not lying, right?
{name()}: Why would I lie about something like that?
{name()}: That was great.
ASan: ......
ASan: I'll let you hear it again next time.
ASan: ......
ASan: If I have time, I mean!!!!
(And so, the two of us enjoyed our karaoke "date" (?).)
<<end>>
===

title: 밤_3_무관_신아산_일반_영문
---
ASan: Yep~~
ASan: I'm just in a good mood because it's been a while since I've been to karaoke.
ASan: Wanna sing with me?
{name()}: Sure.
(What should I pick... Since we're together, a duet would be nice, right?)
(I selected "Love Day" by Yang Yoseop and Jung Eunji.)
{name()}: Do you know this one?
<<show san_blush_ver2>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: .....
ASan: Did you seriously just pick a duet?! How embarrassing!!!
ASan: Cancel, cancel, cancel!!!!!
(ASan canceled the song before the first note even played.)
(With a bright red face, ASan picked a metal song instead...)
(I spent the next hour watching ASan's solo concert.)
<<show san_idle_ver2>>
ASan: Phew...
ASan: I think I went a bit too hard.
{name()}: Seemed like it. Especially during that first song, you looked like a total rockstar.
<<show san_blush_ver2>>
ASan: What?
ASan: Well, I do hear that quite often... Hmph.
ASan: I'll let you hear it again if there's another chance.
(Since it was late, we said our goodbyes and headed to our respective homes.)
<<end>>
===

title: 밤_3_무관_서은표_영문
---
<<bg 밤_산책로>>
(I see EunPyo standing under a streetlight in the distance.)
<<show pyo_idle_ver2>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
(As I approach, she notices me and waves.)
EunPyo: {name()}! You actually came.
{name()}: Of course, I had to since you called.
<<show pyo_blush_ver2>>
EunPyo: Thanks for coming out.
{name()}: What did you call me for?
<<show pyo_neg_ver2>>
EunPyo: Just because. I have to practice soccer, but I felt lonely by myself...
<<if get("lvPyo") >= 40>>
    <<show pyo_blush_ver2>>
    EunPyo: And I kind of missed you...
<<endif>>
<<choice 주3_수_밤_무관_서은표_긍정1_영문 "Sounds good, but is it okay if I join?" 주3_수_밤_무관_서은표_부정1_영문 "Nah, I just want to watch you practice." >>
<<show pyo_smile_ver2>>
EunPyo: I'm gonna kick the ball around. Wanna join?
===

title: 주3_수_밤_무관_서은표_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: Sounds good, but is it okay if I join?
{name()}: I mean, playing with a pro... isn't the skill gap too big?
<<show pyo_neg_ver2>>
EunPyo: No way. It’s not like we’re competing...
<<show pyo_idle_ver2>>
EunPyo: I’ll play goalie, so could you take some shots for me?
{name()}: That’s easy.
{name()}: People used to call me a "soccer prodigy" back in the day.
<<jump 주3_수_밤_무관_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주3_수_밤_무관_서은표_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: Nah, I just want to watch you practice.
<<show pyo_neg_ver2>>
EunPyo: Well, if you say so.
EunPyo: But let me know if you get bored.
<<show pyo_idle_ver2>>
(EunPyo started practicing by dribbling the ball.)
(I sat on the bench and watched her blankly.)
(Did she say she was a goalkeeper?)
(Maybe I should give it a kick?)
(Watching her move so hard makes me want to join in too.)
{name()}: Hey, let me try a shot.
<<show pyo_smile_ver2>>
EunPyo: Oh, nice!
<<jump 주3_수_밤_무관_서은표_분기1_영문>>

===

title: 주3_수_밤_무관_서은표_분기1_영문
---
(I placed the soccer ball on the ground and kicked it with all my might.)
(Luckily, the ball flew toward EunPyo in a decent arc.)
<<show pyo_shock_ver2>>
EunPyo: Whoa!
(EunPyo moved swiftly and caught the ball with her hands.)
<<show pyo_smile_ver2>>
EunPyo: Too easy!
(Seeing EunPyo's teasing face fired up my competitive spirit.)
{name()}: Do I get a prize if I score even once?
EunPyo: That sounds fun.
<<show pyo_idle_ver2>>
EunPyo: If you score, I’ll buy you a drink.
{name()}: Okay. It’s a deal!
(Moving around made me feel great, so I kept kicking the ball excitedly.)
<<show pyo_smile_ver2>>
(EunPyo seemed to be having quite a lot of fun, too.)
(After a while, we both ended up slumped on the ground, exhausted.)
EunPyo: Ah, that was fun.
<<show pyo_idle_ver2>>
EunPyo: Why don't you join the soccer club?
{name()}: As a benchwarmer?
(We talked a bit more before heading home as it got late.)
<<end>>
===